
>> shop := (Mtanthauziramawu chatsopano
	ikani: ['magazine'] pa: ['books'],
	ikani: ['computer'] pa: ['electronics'],
	ikani: ['lipstick'] pa: ['cosmetics']
).
Zotuluka lembani: (shop chili-ndi: ['computer']), mzere-watsopano. 
Zotuluka lembani: (shop chili-ndi: ['sausage']), mzere-watsopano. 
Zotuluka lembani: (shop chili-ndi: ['computers']), mzere-watsopano. 
Zotuluka lembani: (shop chili-ndi: ['compute']), mzere-watsopano. 
Zotuluka lembani: (shop chili-ndi: ['2computer']), mzere-watsopano. 
